- Time: `Attendance_Policies, Geofence_Locations, Shifts, Leave_Types, Leave_Applications, Leave_Balances, Holidays`
- Sites (work-location only): `Sites, Employee_Site_Assignment`
- Payroll: `Salary_Structure, Salary_Components, Salary_Revisions, Loans_Advances, Payroll_Runs, Payroll, Payslips`
