Rules: every row has `id, created_at, updated_at, created_by, updated_by, status`. Soft delete only (status). Batch reads/writes (never cell-by-cell loops). Cache read-heavy lookups (role/permission map, settings) with CacheService and invalidate on change. **Formula-injection protection:** any user-supplied string starting with `= + - @` or tab/CR is stored prefixed with `'`. Validate and sanitize every input by schema. Define column schemas in one place and migrate safely (additive migrations, version stored in Company_Settings).

